hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2804","\n Narrated to us by Al-Abbar ibn al-Ala', who said: Narrated to us by Sufyan, who said: Narrated to us by Ibn Abi Layla, on the authority of Ibn Abi Mulaikah, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Amr (RA), who said: \Jibril (AS) came to Ibrahim (AS) to show him the rites (Manasik) of Hajj.\"" He then mentioned the hadith in its entirety"","" stating: \""Then he (Jibril)"""""
